Package: teather
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Teather Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: adb, libc6, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, pkexec
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Android-hosted Internet relay desktop client
 Teather provides a focused GTK window, tray indicator, CLI, and per-user daemon
 for a temporary TCP and virtual-DNS connection through an authorized Android
 phone over USB/ADB.
